### Estado del servicio
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Buscar especies (ignora acentos y mayúsculas)
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query ($q: String!, $n: Int) { searchSpecies(query: $q, limit: $n) { canonicalName family commonNames { name countryIso } distributions { countryIso occurrenceCount minElevationM maxElevationM } } }",
  "variables": { "q": "almacigo", "n": 3 }
}

### Especies invasoras de un país
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query ($c: String!) { invasiveSpecies(countryIso: $c, limit: 10) { status riskLevel impact management species { canonicalName } } }",
  "variables": { "c": "CO" }
}
